{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27916","headline":"和刘补阙秋园寓兴之什十首 六 · 朱庆余","name":"和刘补阙秋园寓兴之什十首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苍翠经宵在，园庐景自深。\n风凄欲去燕，月思向来砧。\n碧石当莎迳，寒烟冒竹林。\n桮瓢闲寄咏，清绝是知音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27916.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27916","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}